              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paula A DiRusso Daniels"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did improvise, (I added an egg yolk and had to use different chocolate and used walnuts) but the recipe pretty much stayed the same. I will definitely make it again. Its really easy and its delicious.",
            "datePublished": "2017-05-24T10:33:35.310Z"
